 "chunks": [
  {
   "text": "Some zeros are easy: minus two, minus four, minus six,",
   "start": 0.75,
   "end": 4.475
  },
  {
   "text": "and so on, the trivial zeros.",
   "start": 4.475,
   "end": 6.963
  },
  {
   "text": "All the other zeros lie in a narrow band, the critical strip,",
   "start": 6.963,
   "end": 10.325
  },
  {
   "text": "where sigma is between zero and one.",
   "start": 10.325,
   "end": 12.925
  },
  {
   "text": "An exact identity, the functional equation, ties zeta at s to zeta at one minus s.",
   "start": 13.85,
   "end": 19.05
  },
  {
   "text": "Together with zeta's up-down symmetry,",
   "start": 19.05,
   "end": 21.4
  },
  {
   "text": "that mirrors the zeros across the middle of the strip:",
   "start": 21.4,
   "end": 24.4
  },
  {
   "text": "the critical line, real part one half.",
   "start": 24.4,
   "end": 27.462
  },
  {
   "text": "The first zero above the axis sits at one half,",
   "start": 27.462,
   "end": 30.275
  },
  {
   "text": "plus fourteen point one three four seven i.",
   "start": 30.275,
   "end": 33.125
  }
 ],
